#: ../../source/docs/common-3DR_Control_Zero_OEM_G.rst:87
#: 33a9ef6b2d7c407da6237baf17ce3349
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the RC_IN pin. All unidirectional RC protocols are"
" supported. For bi-directional protocols, like CRSF a normal UART is "
"required. For example, USART6 (SERAIL6) could be used."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 RC_IN 引脚上，支持所有单向 RC 协议。对于 CRSF 等双向协议，需要使用普通 UART，例如可使用 "
"USART6（SERIAL6）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3DR_Control_Zero_OEM_G.rst:89
#: 198cb44ce8a8468aafab3744361ed7a3
msgid ""
"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"\"23\", and:"
msgstr "使用此方式时，:ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 必须设置为 '23'，同时："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3DR_Control_Zero_OEM_G.rst:91
#: 84cb556fa2a34efc87fd014b81f6f15a
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3DR_Control_Zero_OEM_G.rst:93
#: 4e6bfaa560e14155b01f99be8a409ff6
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX6  pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接至 RX6 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3DR_Control_Zero_OEM_G.rst:95
#: dcc17da448cb41949530c7d9f7014a5d
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX6 and RX6 via a bi-directional inverter. See "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 需通过双向电平转换器连接至 TX6 和 RX6，详见 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3DR_Control_Zero_OEM_G.rst:97
#: 978d5306e97245dd9d051b7872f64f58
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX6 connection, in addition to RX6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 RX6 外还需连接 TX6，并可自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3DR_Control_Zero_OEM_G.rst:99
#: 63708addf363465fb6e9bed144586486
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX6 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接至 TX6，并可自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 '4'。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3DR_Control_Zero_OEM_G.rst:101
#: f2fa100f997540828ce8fc6220b4a171
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中任何 UART 均可用于 RC 系统连接，支持除 PPM 外的所有协议，详见 :ref:`common-rc-systems`。"

